DreamUMGWidget:bApplyGammaCorrection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/UMG/DreamUMGWidget.h#DreamUMGWidget:bApplyGammaCorrection
    src   "Widget components that appear in the world will be gamma corrected by the 3D renderer.\nIn some cases, widget components are blitted directly into the backbuffer, in which case gamma correction should be enabled."
    // from the engine's zh-Hans
    text  "出现在场景中的控件组件将被3D渲染器伽马校正。\n在某些情况下，控件组件将直接被位块传送到后台缓冲中，此时便需要启用伽马校正。"
    state draft
}

