DreamUMGWidget:RedrawTime {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/UMG/DreamUMGWidget.h#DreamUMGWidget:RedrawTime
    src   "The time in between draws, if 0 - we would redraw every frame.  If 1, we would redraw every second.\nThis will work with bManuallyRedraw as well.  So you can say, manually redraw, but only redraw at this\nmaximum rate."
    // from the engine's zh-Hans
    text  "绘制之间的时间。如为0，则每帧进行重新绘制。如为1，则每秒进行重新绘制。\n这也能结合bManuallyRedraw使用。因此可以进行手动重新绘制，但最大速率便是如此。"
    state draft
}

